OL,3,GNEWSAFrom peace summits to Oasis
OL,4,Abreakups - 50 years at Weston Park
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrothers Roy and Richard Kirby have
OL,7,Fseen just about everything during five
OL,8,Fdecades working at Weston Park in
OL,9,FStaffordshire.
OL,11,FIn that time they have witnessed a G8
OL,12,Fsummit, the final pre-split Oasis
OL,13,Fconcert and dozens of other big events.
OL,15,FThe estate was gifted to the nation in
OL,16,F1986 by the 7th Earl of Bradford and it
OL,17,Fis now owned and cared for by the
OL,18,FWeston Park Foundation, an independent
OL,19,Fcharitable trust.
